When you roll a 20 with this magic weapon, the target takes an extra 7 {=dmgType} damage.

{@note Note: According to the SRD, it is an extra 2d6 {=dmgType} damage, although this is incorrect.}

Special. You have disadvantage when you use a lance to attack a target within 5 feet of you. Also, a lance requires two hands to wield when you aren't mounted.
